      "page": 174,
      "ruku": 144,
      "hizbQuarter": 69,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1138,
      "text": "Have they not reflected that their fellow [Prophet] is not insane? He is none but a clear warner.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 184,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 174,
      "ruku": 144,
      "hizbQuarter": 69,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1139,
      "text": "Have they not observed the dominions of the heavens and earth and all that Allah has created, and that the end of their term might be near? In what message after this [Qur’an] will they then believe?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
